      {
       "content": "<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></ha-icon></summary>\n\nOnce the alarm has been armed away for 30 minutes, comfort control stops and each room is only kept between **Never below** and **Never above**.\n\n</details>",
       "text_only": true,
       "type": "markdown"
      },
