      {
       "heading": "Safety",
       "heading_style": "subtitle",
       "icon": "mdi:shield-check",
       "type": "heading"
      },
      {
       "content": "<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></ha-icon></summary>\n\nWith **Safety limits always** on, frost protection and the away band run even when automatic climate control is off. **Frost override**: a room below this is heated, whatever else applies. **House hysteresis**: how far past a house-mode threshold the outdoor temperature must go before the season changes. **Room deadband**: how far a room must drift back past its target before its unit starts again.\n\n</details>",
       "text_only": true,
       "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
       "color": "green",
       "entity": "input_boolean.climate_safety_always",
       "grid_options": {
