       "content": "<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></ha-icon></summary>\n\nCorrections for the AC's own probe and the radiator valves' probes, applied wherever those readings are used. A value outside the plausible range (beyond ±3 °C, or below −3.5 °C for the AC) is treated as a mistake, and those probes are ignored in favour of their backups.\n\n</details>",
