      {
       "content": "<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></ha-icon></summary>\n\nNext to each room: **Auto**, the automation controls the room; **Filter**, keep the unit running for its filter, in the season's mode at the room's target, fan only in shoulder weather (needs automatic climate control on); **Warm-up**, heat early so the room is at its day target when the night ends. Coloured means on; tap one to switch it. **Day** and **Night**: the target for each.\n\n</details>",
       "text_only": true,
       "type": "markdown"
      },
