      {
       "heading": "Manual control",
       "heading_style": "subtitle",
       "icon": "mdi:hand-back-right",
       "type": "heading"
      },
      {
       "content": "{% set rooms = [('Living room','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_living_room'),('Office','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_office'),('Bedroom','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_bedroom'),('Kids room 1','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_kid1'),('Kids room 2','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_kid2')] %}{% set ns = namespace(held=[]) %}{% for n, e in rooms %}{% set t = state_attr(e,'timestamp') %}{% if t and now().timestamp() < t %}{% set ns.held = ns.held + [n ~ ' (until ' ~ (t | timestamp_custom('%H:%M')) ~ ')'] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if ns.held %}✋ **Manual: {{ ns.held | join(', ') }}**{% else %}No manual holds.{% endif %}\n\n<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></ha-icon></summary>\n\nChanging a unit by hand (remote, app or wall) hands that room to you for **Hold for** hours; then the automation takes over again.\n\n</details>",
       "text_only": true,
       "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
       "color": "purple",
       "entity": "input_number.climate_manual_hold_hours",
       "features": [
        {
         "style": "buttons",
         "type": "numeric-input"
        }
       ],
       "grid_options": {
        "columns": 12
       },
       "name": "Hold for",
       "type": "tile"
      },
      {
       "heading": "Circuit breaker",
       "heading_style": "subtitle",
       "icon": "mdi:electric-switch",
       "type": "heading"
      },
      {
       "content": "{% set b = states('input_number.climate_breaker_threshold') | int(3) %}{% set rooms = [('Living room','counter.climate_fail_living_room'),('Office','counter.climate_fail_office'),('Bedroom','counter.climate_fail_bedroom'),('Kids room 1','counter.climate_fail_kid1'),('Kids room 2','counter.climate_fail_kid2')] %}{% set ns = namespace(bad=[]) %}{% for n, c in rooms %}{% if states(c) | int(0) >= b %}{% set ns.bad = ns.bad + [n] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if ns.bad %}🔌 **Isolated: {{ ns.bad | join(', ') }}**{% else %}All five units responding to commands.{% endif %}\n\n<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></ha-icon></summary>\n\nA unit that ignores **Trip after** commands in a row, each checked **Settle** seconds after it was sent, is isolated: comfort commands drop to one retry an hour, safety keeps its full rate. It clears itself the moment the unit obeys.\n\n</details>",
       "text_only": true,
       "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
       "cards": [
        {
         "color": "amber",
         "entity": "input_number.climate_breaker_threshold",
